[[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891739\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892268\">7055B42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891452\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891450\">1092A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891232\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891354\">1016A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891350\">1008C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891351\">1008C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891366\">1032B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891398\">1060E30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891407\">1060F50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891403\">1060F20</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the fuel pressure regulator.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Fuel pressure regulator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890977\">N77</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect the fuel inlet hose from its fitting on the pump.</p><p>3. Unscrew the nuts retaining the pump to the mount.</p><p>4. Remove the pressure pump.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034153.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the pressure pump to its mount.</p><p>Tighten the nuts securing the pump to the\nmount to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CYLINDER HEAD</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the fuel inlet line to the pump.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nfuel pressure regulator.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Fuel pressure regulator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890977\">N77</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2891403\">1060F20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891407\">1060F50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891398\">1060E30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891366\">1032B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891351\">1008C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891350\">1008C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891354\">1016A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891232\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891450\">1092A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891452\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892268\">7055B42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891739\">4450B10</a></p>"]]